- If any value in the integer array parameter `nums` appears at least twice, the boolean result is equal to the true literal.
- If every element in the integer array parameter `nums` is distinct, the boolean result is equal to the false literal.
- The length of the integer array parameter `nums` is greater than or equal to 1 and is less than or equal to 100000.
- All values in the integer array parameter `nums` are greater than or equal to -1000000000 and are less than or equal to 1000000000.